<title>USA: Urethane in talks about business alliance.</title>
<headline>Urethane in talks about business alliance.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ANA, Calif. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urethane Technologies Inc said on Monday it is engaged in talks with another company in the polyurethane industry about a possible business alliance.</p>
<p>Urethane Technologies said it has postponed a conference call set for August 27, 1996, as a result of the discussions.</p>
<p>Details of the business alliance were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
